			"notes": "## Connecto v1.3.1 Release\n\nFabric Server Mod for Minecraft 26.1.2.\n\n### Installation\n1. Download `connecto-1.3.1.jar`.\n2. Place it in your server's `mods/` directory.\n3. Configure `config/connecto.json` with `\"enabled\": true` and add your whitelisted usernames.\n4. Restart the server."
